  "project_description": "Coffre-fort is an open source project , to help secure all types of highly confidential information from being leaked before the right time.\n\n Features:\n\n - All private data are encrypted before being saved in database.\n\n- Data encryptions is protected by user provided password. so there is no way to unlock the coffre-fort and view private data.\n\n- Once unlocked, you can view all private data.\n\n- If locked, replacement data values will be used instead of the secret values.\n\n- All private data names are exposed as tokens , so they can be used on contents , blocks, configurations ..\n\n- Password protection can be modified or replaced by any different secret provider.",
